{
  "_comment": "Canonical cross-runtime mines:v1 test vectors. Reproducible by any runtime (native Rust, wasm, TS) from the pinned algorithm below. All values are integer/ppm; no floating point. Generated by an independent python3 reference: libs/games/scripts/gen_vectors.py.",
  "algorithm": {
    "game_type": "mines:v1",
    "grid": "5x5 = 25 tiles, indices 0..24; mine_count in 1..=24",
    "seed_derivation": "base stream = blake2b-256 of b'game-seed|'+game_type+'|'+server_seed+'|'+client_seed+'|'+(0).to_le_bytes(i32). When a draw needs bytes past the end, extend the stream with the same derivation at action_index = current_stream_length / 32 (so extensions use indices 1, 2, ...). The layout is fixed at bet time; gameplay actions derive nothing",
    "layout": "partial Fisher-Yates over tiles [0..25): draw i consumes 4 stream bytes as a little-endian u32 raw; swap_index = i + ((raw * (25 - i)) >> 32) (Lemire wide-reduction, unbiased); swap tiles[i] <-> tiles[swap_index]. After mine_count draws, mines = sorted(tiles[0..mine_count])",
    "step_multiplier": "revealing the k-th safe tile (k 0-indexed): fair_step_ppm = half_up((25 - k) * 1e6 / (safe - k)) with safe = 25 - mine_count. The house edge is charged once per round, on the first reveal: offered_step_ppm = half_up(fair_step_ppm * 995000 / 1e6) for k = 0, and offered_step_ppm = fair_step_ppm for k >= 1",
    "cumulative": "starts at 1e6; each safe reveal multiplies: cum = half_up(cum * offered_step_ppm / 1e6), so cum(k) = 0.995 * fair(k) and RTP is 99.5% at every stopping depth. Revealing a mine sets 0 and settles as a loss. Revealing the last safe tile auto-settles as a win",
    "payout": "cashout (allowed after >= 1 reveal) pays stake * cumulative_multiplier_ppm / 1e6 rounded half-up (exact for integer stakes: at most 6 decimal places); a mine hit pays 0. The system 'abandon' action settles as lose / 0",
    "action_borsh": "place-bet payload = borsh(Config { mine_count: u32 LE }); reveal payload = borsh(tile_index: u32 LE); cashout payload is empty",
    "house_edge_ppm": 995000,
    "scale_ppm": 1000000,
    "rounding": "half-up (midpoint away from zero), mirroring game-engine-core/src/fixed_point.rs"
  },
